# GMS: 140+2x% seven times on 8 enemies, and everything it touches burns for
# 120+4x% a second for five seconds. Both ladders are GMS's own.
#
# The burn is the first effect over time the game keeps. Every earlier one was
# dropped, because a map mob dies inside a swing and a few seconds of ticking
# never arrived -- what changed is that this class is built on them.
name: "Flame Sweep"
skill_order: 1
description:
  "A fire-attribute attack. Sweep the area in front of you with a powerful "
  "flame. Enemies struck by the flame are burned and take continuous damage."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_FIRE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_FIRE_POISON_ARCH_MAGE
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
exceeds_master_level: true
base_delay_ms: 660
max_enemies: 8
lines: 7
